Filament 1.69.2 16KB JNI relink
================================

Upstream: https://github.com/google/filament
Tag: v1.69.2
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-filament.txt after extract, or
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt)

This directory contains a local rebuild recipe. It is not a Google release
and not a product Gradle / device result.

Static engine libraries come from the official GitHub asset
filament-v1.69.2-android-native.tgz. JNI shared objects are relinked from
the matching tag sources with:

  -Wl,-z,max-page-size=16384
  -Wl,-z,common-page-size=16384

Official v1.69.2 Android CMake already sets max-page-size only, which is why
LOAD 16KB passes on Maven AARs while GNU_RELRO end alignment fails for
libfilament-jni.so and libfilament-utils-jni.so.
